shoot:description:A couple weeks ago we made a trip up to (and across) the Strait of Juan de Fuca.  On the ferry to Vancouver Island, I spotted a couple lifer Pomarine Jaegers, and I'm fairly sure I saw a Parasitic Jaeger as well but I wasn't able to get a photo.  Other birds I was happy to see included Heermann's Gull, Short-billed Gull, and a flock of Black-bellied Plover.
